we need to know IAM, S3, EC2 (to sync s3 to EC2)

1 (EC2 TO S3)

1, create a user in IAM (permissins  AdministratorAccess, and download access key info)
2, launch an instance while launching instance use created iam role
3, aws configure (run this command)
4, aws s3 sync /var/www/html s3://bucketname/location (we have to give source and destination)

2 (S3 TO EC2)

1, region should be same (bucket and EC2)
2, create a role in IAM (S3 full access for EC2 )
3, goto the location where you wants to sync 
4, aws s3 cp s3://bucketname/filename /var/www/html (source and destionation)
